WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.833
Okay!

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:04.267
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:04.933
A.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:05.633
Motorcycle,

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:06.333
B.

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:07.000
Shovel,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.700
C.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.367
Hammer,

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:09.767
or D.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:10.433
Axe?

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:11.800
Five seconds!

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.267
TIME'S UP!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.167
The answer is...

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:20.633
A,

00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:21.133
motorcycle!

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:21.633
Axe,

00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:22.100
hammer,

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.533
and shovel are all tools.

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:27.000
Motorcycle is a road vehicle,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.433
so it does not belong.

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:31.000
Here's one,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.600
a picture puzzle!

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.800
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:36.333
A.

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:36.867
Top,

00:00:36.867 --> 00:00:37.433
B.

00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:37.967
Left,

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:38.500
C.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.033
Top-left,

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:40.100
or D.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:40.633
Top-right?

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:41.700
Five seconds!

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.133
TIME'S UP!

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:49.833
The answer is...

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:50.267
A,

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:50.667
top!

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:53.200
The dot moves one spot counter-clockwise

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.300
around the grid each step,

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.833
so the next spot is top.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:00:59.633
Here's one,

00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:01.567
a number series!

00:01:01.567 --> 00:01:02.200
Four,

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:02.833
two,

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:03.467
six,

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.100
eight,

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:04.733
fourteen,

00:01:04.733 --> 00:01:06.000
and then...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.933
what comes next?

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:08.567
A.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:09.200
Twelve,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:09.833
B.

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:10.467
Thirty-two,

00:01:10.467 --> 00:01:11.100
C.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:11.733
Twenty-two,

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:13.000
or D.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:13.667
Twenty-seven?

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:14.933
Five seconds!

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:21.367
TIME'S UP!

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.833
What's your answer?

00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:24.900
Comment below and I'll let you

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.333
know if you're a Certified Smart Fella!
